# Function type alias with one param: [Mapper: [type [let a b] [Fn@b [a]]]]
# represents an (a → b) function type. [@[Mapper Integer String]] expands to
# [Fn@String [Integer]], enforcing that the lambda takes Int and returns String.
[
  Mapper: [type [let a b] [Fn@b [a]]]
  f: [@[Mapper Integer String] [fn [let v@Integer] "result"]]
  result: [f 42]
]
=== out
Dict({"Mapper": Dict({}), "f": Function(v), "result": String("result")})
